<% content_for :meta_title, "Privacy Policy | Red Tape LA" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "How Red Tape LA collects, uses, and protects your information. Your privacy is our priority." %>

<div class="hero-about">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      How we handle your information
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container-narrow">

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Commitment</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      Your privacy is our priority. We collect only what we need to document LA's housing bureaucracy and advocate for reform. We never sell your data or share your personal information publicly.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Collect</h2>

    <p class="text-large"><strong>When you share a story:</strong></p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Your email address (for verification only)<br>
      • Project details (type, location, description)<br>
      • Timeline and financial impact<br>
      • Departments and issue categories involved<br>
      • Optional solution ideas
    </p>

    <p class="text-large"><strong>Website usage:</strong></p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Basic analytics (pages visited, time on site)<br>
      • IP address and browser information<br>
      • Cookies for site functionality
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">How We Use Your Information</h2>

    <p class="text-large"><strong>Your story:</strong></p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Verified via email confirmation<br>
      • Reviewed by our team<br>
      • Analyzed to identify patterns and systemic issues<br>
      • Shared in anonymized, aggregated form with policymakers, journalists, and advocacy organizations
    </p>

    <p class="text-large"><strong>Your contact info:</strong></p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Used only to verify your email address<br>
      • Stored securely in our database<br>
      • Never shared publicly or with officials<br>
      • Never sold or given to third parties
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Public Stories</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      If you opt in to share your story publicly, your <strong>story content</strong> will appear on our Public Stories page. Your name and email address remain private. All public stories are anonymous.
    </p>
    <p class="text-large">
      You choose whether to make your story public when you submit it. You can opt out at any time by emailing us at <a href="mailto:john@redtape.la">john@redtape.la</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Data Security</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      We use industry-standard security practices to protect your information:
    </p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Secure database storage<br>
      • Encrypted connections (HTTPS)<br>
      • Regular security updates<br>
      • Limited team access to contact information
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      You have the right to:
    </p>
    <p class="text-large">
      • Request a copy of your data<br>
      • Request deletion of your story and contact information<br>
      • Opt out of public story sharing<br>
      • Update or correct your information
    </p>
    <p class="text-large">
      Email us at <a href="mailto:john@redtape.la">john@redtape.la</a> to exercise any of these rights.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      We use essential cookies to make the site work (like remembering if you're logged in). We use analytics cookies to understand how people use the site. We don't use advertising cookies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      Red Tape LA is not intended for use by anyone under 18. We don't knowingly collect information from children.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p class="text-large">
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We'll notify users by email if we make significant changes.
    </p>
    <p class="text-large">
      Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Questions?</h2>
    <p class="text-large mb-0">
      Email us at <a href="mailto:john@redtape.la">john@redtape.la</a> with any questions about how we handle your information.
    </p>
  </section>

</div>
